      "body_recovery_method": "wayback",
      "context_excerpt": "Foxconn is leading the way. At its Taiwan facilities, Foxconn engineers rely on the Fii Digital Twin platform , developed with OpenUSD, Siemens and Omniverse technologies, to design and simulate robot work cells, assembly lines and entire factory layouts.",
      "entity_name_normalized_hint": "Fii Digital Twin platform",
